  "releaseNotes": "First public Kypelon.Pdf alpha, by Konkaew. Native PDF writer and layout engine; prepared text/shaped-line pipeline; deterministic preparation validation; reusable PreparedPdfDocument; Unicode/Thai foundation; tables and pagination; ASP.NET streaming. Alpha API: no real GSUB/GPOS, bidi or font fallback; Thai advanced typography is incomplete. Reader/Edit, signing and PDF/A or PDF/UA conformance are not implemented.",
